%T A243320 5664125233,224316411998,12152666403960,899405628717371,
%U A243320 90863213472671017,12529365137889698168,2358609867733341684841,606427029512232031309034,213076105689598975157955990
%N A243320 Number of simple connected graphs with n nodes that are bipartite and Eulerian.
%H A243320 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A243320/b243320.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..100</a>
%H A243320 Travis Hoppe and Anna Petrone, <a href="https://github.com/thoppe/Encyclopedia-of-Finite-Graphs">Encyclopedia of Finite Graphs</a>
%H A243320 Travis Hoppe and Anna Petrone, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1408.3644">Integer sequence discovery from small graphs</a>, arXiv preprint arXiv:1408.3644 [math.CO], 2014.
%H A243320 Falk Hüffner, <a href="https://github.com/falk-hueffner/tinygraph">tinygraph</a>, software for generating integer sequences based on graph properties, version 69d4186
%F A243320 From _Vladeta Jovovic_, Oct 08 2026: (Start)
%F A243320 a(n) = (A400899(n) + A400900(n))/2, where A400899(n) is the number of isomorphism classes of connected simple Eulerian graphs on n vertices with a proper vertex coloring in two named colors, red and blue; every edge joins vertices of different colors, and isomorphisms must preserve the colors.
%F A243320 The number A400900(n) counts those classes having an automorphism that interchanges the two parts of the bipartition (the red and blue vertex sets). (End)
%e A243320 For n = 6, the two graphs are the cycle C_6 and the complete bipartite graph K_{2,4}.
%e A243320 For C_6, a rotation by one vertex interchanges the red and blue vertex sets, so the two colorings give one color-preserving isomorphism class.
%e A243320 For K_{2,4}, the two colorings give distinct color-preserving isomorphism classes. No automorphism can interchange the two parts, since they have different sizes.
%e A243320 Thus A400899(6) = 3, A400900(6) = 1, and a(6) = (3 + 1)/2 = 2.
%Y A243320 Cf. A005142 (bipartite graphs), A003049 (Eulerian graphs), A400899, A400900.
%K A243320 nonn,changed
%O A243320 1,6
%A A243320 _Travis Hoppe_ and _Anna Petrone_, Jun 03 2014
%E A243320 a(11)-a(16) added using tinygraph by _Falk Hüffner_, Jan 15 2016
%E A243320 a(17) and beyond from _Vladeta Jovovic_, Oct 08 2026
